# Kitnap, gift not promised, destroyed in response to its enters trigger: "tap enchanted creature ... put three stun counters on
# it" reads the creature the Aura was attached to as it left (CR 608.2h, last-known information), so Bot2's Ornithopter, back
# under Bot2's control once the control effect ends with the Aura (CR 611.2a, 613.1b), is still tapped and gets three stun
# counters (CR 701.26a, 122.1d, 702.174).

